          "text": "Description: On April 14, 2010, a witness observed in the sky a phenomenon that intrigued them. Between 10:00 PM and midnight, looking south, they observed a glowing object with color variations. They filmed a portion of their observation. No particular noise was heard. The investigation determined that the witness made an astronomical observation of the star Sirius (see the investigation report).",
